{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17851","headline":"省中直夜对雪寄李师素侍郎 · 令狐楚","name":"省中直夜对雪寄李师素侍郎","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"密雪纷初降，重城杳未开。\n杂花飞烂熳，连蝶舞徘徊。\n洒散千株叶，销凝九陌埃。\n素华凝粉署，清气绕霜台。\n明觉侵窗积，寒知度塞来。\n谢家争拟絮，越岭悞惊梅。\n暗魄微茫照，严飙次第催。\n稍封黄竹亚，先集紫兰摧。\n孙室临书幌，梁园泛酒杯。\n静怀琼树倚，醉忆玉山颓。\n翠陌饥乌噪，苍云远鴈哀。\n此时方夜直，想望意悠哉。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"令狐楚","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_17851.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17851","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}